00:00:29.383 --> 00:00:30.103
I'm on board.

00:00:30.103 --> 00:00:32.193
- There's like a pee vibe
I'm getting on this one.

00:00:32.193 --> 00:00:32.820
Pee pee?

00:00:32.820 --> 00:00:34.770
- It's cardboard-y.

00:00:34.770 --> 00:00:36.837
- Whoa!

00:00:36.837 --> 00:00:38.555
This is like a little cider-y.

00:00:38.555 --> 00:00:41.920
- Bud Light is a little
aggressive compared to this.

00:00:45.195 --> 00:00:47.030
- [Voiceover] Indio.

00:00:47.030 --> 00:00:50.396
- To be honest, to me, this
does not taste good at all.

00:00:50.396 --> 00:00:52.950
- This is like a Mexican Guinness.

00:00:52.950 --> 00:00:54.135
- Okay, that's got more kick.

00:00:54.135 --> 00:00:55.992
- This tastes sort of the same.

00:00:55.992 --> 00:00:57.037
- They're way different.

00:00:57.037 --> 00:01:00.030
- I like that one.
- Yeah, it's caramel-y.

00:01:02.238 --> 00:01:04.212
- Oh, Modelo!

00:01:05.473 --> 00:01:06.942
- (chanting) Modelo, Modelo!

00:01:06.942 --> 00:01:09.449
- This is like the chode of beer bottles.

00:01:09.449 --> 00:01:10.680
It's short and stout.

00:01:10.680 --> 00:01:14.325
