00:01:26.389 --> 00:01:27.480
- Not for me.

00:01:27.480 --> 00:01:28.920
Tastes like weed.

00:01:28.920 --> 00:01:30.174
- Fucking good.

00:01:30.174 --> 00:01:33.028
It's really fucking good.

00:01:33.703 --> 00:01:35.096
- [Voiceover] I was gonna
use the bottle opener,

00:01:35.096 --> 00:01:37.455
but Tecate's...

00:01:37.455 --> 00:01:38.848
- I like see it, and I trust it.

00:01:38.848 --> 00:01:40.334
It has this like trustworthy...

00:01:40.334 --> 00:01:40.941
- [Voiceover] You trust it, it's like a...

00:01:40.941 --> 00:01:42.055
- I trust the red.

00:01:42.055 --> 00:01:43.263
- That's fine.

00:01:43.263 --> 00:01:45.598
- These are the worst.

00:01:45.598 --> 00:01:46.620
- That is smooth.

00:01:46.620 --> 00:01:48.175
That's the smoothest one we've had so far.

00:01:48.175 --> 00:01:50.497
- It's okay.
- Tastes like pee.

00:01:50.497 --> 00:01:53.119
