00:01:56.906 --> 00:01:58.276
- Victoria.

00:01:58.276 --> 00:02:00.990
- Victoria.
(laughs)

00:02:01.248 --> 00:02:02.989
- This tastes like nothing to me.

00:02:02.989 --> 00:02:05.195
- That's a nice beer.
- That's a good beer!

00:02:05.195 --> 00:02:06.100
- I like this beer.

00:02:06.100 --> 00:02:08.188
(mimics choir singing)

00:02:08.585 --> 00:02:09.583
- I like it.

00:02:09.583 --> 00:02:11.346
(mimics trumpet)

00:02:12.159 --> 00:02:13.368
- They're all good.

00:02:13.368 --> 00:02:14.854
This one's best.

00:02:14.854 --> 00:02:18.559
