00:02:18.559 --> 00:02:19.627
- Modelo.

00:02:19.627 --> 00:02:21.439
- [Voiceover] Yeah, it was
the best one, for sure.

00:02:21.439 --> 00:02:23.366
- If I'm like already really drunk,

00:02:23.366 --> 00:02:24.503
I'm gonna go for Sol.

00:02:24.503 --> 00:02:28.288
But this one tastes like
cider, so I'm a big fan.

00:02:28.288 --> 00:02:30.703
- I like Modelo 'cause it
actually tastes like beer.

00:02:30.703 --> 00:02:33.721
- I like Miss La Victoria.

00:02:33.721 --> 00:02:35.927
- I like Victoria; I like the name of it.

00:02:35.927 --> 00:02:39.410
- I know why Corona's the
most popular Mexican beer.

00:02:39.410 --> 00:02:41.583
It really does taste the best.

00:02:41.583 --> 00:02:43.138
- This is the best one.

00:02:43.138 --> 00:02:44.717
- Indio's my favorite.

00:02:44.717 --> 00:02:47.759
