00:02:48.724 --> 00:02:49.514
Oh, it's mine.

00:02:49.514 --> 00:02:50.466
Oh no it's not, it's yours.

00:02:50.466 --> 00:02:51.209
- Get in here.

00:02:51.209 --> 00:02:53.923
- Why are these bottles...
- We're cheersing!

00:02:54.970 --> 00:02:56.756
(laughs)

00:03:02.191 --> 00:03:03.584
